      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "今天咱们聊聊手机，你有没有觉得手机就像个定时炸弹？",
      "characters": [
        "host",
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act03",
      "name": "第 3 幕",
      "scene": "dressing_room_vhs",
      "camera": "handheld",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "那必须的，手机不响我还真觉得哪儿不对劲。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act04",
      "name": "第 4 幕",
      "scene": "city_vhs",
      "camera": "pan_right",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "对，就是那种响个不停，生怕漏了任何一条信息的感觉。",
      "characters": [
        "host",
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act05",
      "name": "第 5 幕",
      "scene": "brick_wall",
      "camera": "static",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "figure_b",
      "text": "我还真琢磨过，要是手机突然没电了，是不是整个世界都会跟着安静几分？",
      "characters": [
        "figure_b"
      ],
      "broll": false
